   "source": [
    "# DDPG: Swinging Up a Pendulum using Gymnasium\n",
    "Train a Deep Deterministic Policy Gradient (DDPG) agent to solve the `Pendulum-v1` environment using PyTorch and Gymnasium."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "ea83701f",
